{"id":"00409","root":"uni00409_1","name":{"ja":"穂稀　なお","en":"Homare Nao"},"title":{"ja":"【クリスマス】","en":"【Christmas】"},"displayName":{"ja":"【クリスマス】 穂稀　なお","en":"【Christmas】 Homare Nao"},"element":"Science","rarity":6,"rarityLabel":"LR","roles":[],"traits":["Taimanin"],"release":"2020-12-15","limited":true,"characterId":194,"profile":{"ja":"対魔忍。将来を期待されている若き新戦力。光遁の術の一種で、光を集める忍法“集光”を操る。血の滲むような鍛錬を重ね、鋼鉄も溶かすほどの光のエネルギーを集める力を得た。さらにその光のエネルギーをコントロールする特殊なライフル“バルドル”により、レーザー光線を放つ事ができる。この“バルドル”には光のエネルギーを蓄えておくこともでき、光の届かない場所や夜の時間帯でも力を発揮できる。容姿の整った美少年で、よく美少女と間違われるのが悩みだというが、“可愛い”ものが大好きゆえ、デザインが可愛いという理由でいつも女物の服を着ている本人にも原因がある。もちろん制服も女子生徒用のものを着用している。","en":"He is a Taimanin, a young new asset expected to shine in the future. He wields the light-style ninjutsu \"Gather Light,\" a technique that gathers light. Through blood-soaked training he has gained the power to collect light energy strong enough to melt steel. With his special rifle \"Baldur,\" which controls that light energy, he can fire laser beams. The Baldur can also store light energy, letting him use his power even in darkness or at night. He has a well-kept, beautiful boyish appearance and is often mistaken for a girl—a source of frustration—but he loves anything \"cute,\" so he always wears women's clothing because the designs are adorable, including a girls' school uniform."},"illustrator":"ばん！","voiceActor":"三十三七","forms":[{"id":"uni00409_1","rarity":4,"rarityLabel":"SR","levelMax":80,"stats":{"hp":[1042,2084],"sp":[160,160],"atk":[159,318],"def":[101,202],"spd":[83,83],"luck":[1,100]},"spCharge":40,"skills":["5","880001"],"evolve":[["evo00013",5],["evo00014",15],["evo00015",5],["evo00017",1]]},{"id":"uni00409_2","rarity":5,"rarityLabel":"UR","levelMax":90,"stats":{"hp":[1584,3168],"sp":[230,230],"atk":[253,506],"def":[137,274],"spd":[83,83],"luck":[1,100]},"spCharge":40,"skills":["5","880001","880002"],"evolve":[["evo00014",10],["evo00015",15],["evo00016",4],["evo00017",2]]},{"id":"uni00409_3","rarity":6,"rarityLabel":"LR","