},{"text":"This attack: crit rate +50%"}]}},"leader":{"name":{"ja":"聖なる風紀隊隊長"},"detail":{"ja":"科学属性ユニットのSPDを大アップ"},"effects":[{"text":"Science allies: SPD +20%","icon":"spd_up"}]},"abilities":[],"bloom":{"points":1,"gold":1,"status":1,"bonus":1,"items":[[1,"blo00002",80],[1,"blo00006",1],[2,"blo00007",15],[3,"blo00010",15],[4,"blo00013",15],[5,"blo00007",15],[6,"blo00010",15],[7,"blo00013",15],[8,"blo00007",15],[9,"blo00010",10],[9,"blo00011",10],[10,"blo00007",10],[10,"blo00008",10],[11,"blo00013",10],[11,"blo00014",10],[12,"blo00002",160],[12,"blo00006",2],[13,"blo00007",10],[13,"blo00008",10],[14,"blo00010",10],[14,"blo00011",10],[15,"blo00013",10],[15,"blo00014",10],[16,"blo00007",10],[16,"blo00008",10],[17,"blo00010",10],[17,"blo00011",10],[18,"blo00013",10],[18,"blo00014",10],[19,"blo00007",10],[19,"blo00008",10],[20,"blo00010",5],[20,"blo00011",15],[20,"blo00012",5],[21,"blo00007",5],[21,"blo00008",15],[21,"blo00009",5],[22,"blo00013",5],[22,"blo00014",15],[22,"blo00015",5],[23,"blo00010",5],[23,"blo00011",15],[23,"blo00012",5],[24,"blo00007",5],[24,"blo00008",15],[24,"blo00009",5],[25,"blo00013",5],[25,"blo00014",15],[25,"blo00015",5],[26,"blo00002",80],[26,"blo00006",1],[27,"blo00008",3],[27,"blo00011",3],[27,"blo00014",3],[28,"blo00008",3],[28,"blo00011",3],[28,"blo00014",3],[29,"blo00008",3],[29,"blo00011",3],[29,"blo00014",3],[30,"blo00008",3],[30,"blo00011",3],[30,"blo00014",3],[31,"blo00002",160],[31,"blo00006",2],[32,"blo00008",3],[32,"blo00011",3],[32,"blo00014",3],[33,"blo00008",3],[33,"blo00011",3],[33,"blo00014",3],[34,"blo00008",3],[34,"blo00011",3],[34,"blo00014",3],[35,"blo00008",3],[35,"blo00011",3],[35,"blo00014",3],[36,"blo00002",160],[36,"blo00006",2],[37,"blo00008",3],[37,"blo00011",3],[37,"blo00014",3],[38,"blo00008",3],[38,"blo00011",3],[38,"blo00014",3],[39,"blo00008",3],[39,"blo00011",3],[39,"blo00014",3],[40,"blo00008",3],[40,"blo00011",3],[40,"blo00014",3],[41,"blo00002",160],[41,"blo00006",2],[42,"blo00008",3],[42,"blo00011",3],[42,"blo00014",3],[43,"blo00008",3],[43,"blo00011",3],[43,"blo00014",3],[44,"blo00008",3],[44,"blo00011",3],[44,"blo00014",3],[45,"blo00008",3],[45,"blo00011",3],[45,"blo00014",3],[46,"blo00002",160],[46,"blo00006",2],[47,"blo00008",3],[47,"blo00009",1],[47,"blo00011",3],[47,"blo00012",1],[47,"blo00014",3],[47,"blo00015",1],[48,"blo00008",3],[48,"blo00009",1],[48,"blo00011",3],[48,"blo00012",1],[48,"blo00014",3],[48,"blo00015",1],[49,"blo00008",3],[49,"blo00009",1],[49,"blo00011",3],[49,"blo00012",1],[49,"blo00014",3],[49,"blo00015",1],[50,"blo00008",3],[50,"blo00009",1],[50,"blo00011",3],[50,"blo00012",1],[50,"blo00014",3],[50,"blo00015",1]]},"voices":[{"type":"new","label":"Acquired","variant":"base","index":1,"text":{"ja":"メリークリスマス♪　どうだい、聖なる夜のための特別な穂稀なおは。見惚れるのはいいけど僕は男だからね、変な視線はお断りだよ","en":"Merry Christmas♪ How about this special Homare Nao for the holy night? You can stare all you want, but I'm a guy, so weird looks are declined."},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00409_1/uni00409_1_new_1.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":1,"text":{"ja":"これかい？　もちろん、君のためのプレゼントさ。可愛くなるためのね♪","en":"This? Of course, it's a present for you. To make you cute♪"},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00409_1/uni00409_1_hom_1.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":2,"text":{"ja":"可愛いだろう？　このスーツ。聖なる夜もそうだけど……ふふ、君のための特別でもあるんだよ？","en":"Cute, right? This suit. It's perfect for the holy night… hehe, it's also special just for you."},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00409_1/uni00409_1_hom_2.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":3,"text":{"ja":"そんなに見つめて……可愛くても僕は男だっていったろう？　くすっ、確かめてみるかい？　なんてね","en":"Staring at me like that… I told you I'm a guy even if I'm cute, right? Heh, want to test that? Just kidding."},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00409_1/uni00409_1_hom_3.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":4,"text":{"ja":"まったく君ときたら、僕がこんなに可愛く着飾ってるのに普段と変わらないなんて。やれやれ、僕が見繕って上げるよ","en":"Seriously, you act the same even though I'm dressed so cutely. Well then, I'll pick something out for you."},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00409_1/uni00409_1_hom_4.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":5,"text":{"ja":"ねえ、君もおそろいにしてみない？　嫌なのかい、君なら、僕と同じで可愛くなれると思うのに、もったいない","en":"Hey, why don't we match? You don't mind, right? I think you could be as cute as me, it'd be a waste not to."},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00409_1/uni00409_1_hom_5.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":6,"text":{"ja":"ふふ、今日の僕はパーティーの視線を独り占めしちゃうかもね……ま、百の視線も君の視線ほどの価値はないだろうけど","en":"Heh, today I might hog all the party's attention… though a hundred gazes don't equal yours."},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00409_1/uni00409_1_hom_6.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":7,"text":{"ja":"いつも女と間違われるのは面倒だけれど……でも、そのくらい可愛いセンスしているように見えるのかなって思うと、そう悪くもないかな","en":"Being mistaken for a girl is a hassle, but… thinking that maybe it means I have a cute sense, that's not so bad."},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00409_1/uni00409_1_hom_7.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"r18","index":1,"text":{"ja":"ふふふ、こういう格好の僕は、どうかな……？","en":"Hehe, how does this look on me…?"},"clip":"Audio/Voice_r18/uni00409_1_hom_r18_1.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"r18","index":2,"text":{"ja":"いやらしい目つきだね……でも君に見てもらえるのは、すごく、嬉しい……","en":"That's a lewd look… but I'm really happy you're looking at me."},"clip":"Audio/Voice_r18/uni00409_1_hom_r18_2.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"r18","index":3,"text":{"ja":"もう……着ただけでおちんちんが反応しちゃうのは、君がいつも可愛がるからだよ？","en":"Geez… just wearing this makes my… react because you always pamper me, you know?"},"clip":"Audio/Voice_r18/uni00409_1_hom_r18_3.ogg"},{"type":"atk","label":"Attack","variant":"base","index":1,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00409_1/uni00409_1_atk_1.ogg"},{"type":"atk","label":"Attack","variant":"base","index":2,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00409_1/uni00409_1_atk_2.ogg"},{"type":"atk","label":"Attack","variant":"base","index":3,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00409_1/uni00409_1_atk_3.ogg"},{"type"